      "category": "Text",
      "text": "RESOLVED, that the Board of Education, the Chancellor, and all\nCommunity School Boards and Community Superintendents within the\nCity School District of the City of New York shall provide to the\nCommission upon request any and all documents, records, reports,\nfiles or other information, except such documents as cannot be so\ndisclosed according to law. To insure full availability of such\nrecords and documents to the Commission, the Board of Education,\nthe Chancellor, and all Community School Boards and Community\nSuperintendents shall make and retain copies of any documents,\nrecords or files provided to state or federal prosecutors, or\nother investigative bodies, pursuant to subpoena or otherwise.",
